            <div xml:id="d638">

                <pb facs="0658" n="648" sameAs="frus:frus1937v05/pg648"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/2947: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Mexico</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Boal</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-12T19:00:00-04:00">July 12, 1937—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>138. Your 184, July 10, 5 p.m. The Department is making a study of the points
                    raised in your telegram. Meanwhile your attention is invited to Embassy’s
                    despatch 245 January 11, 1928<anchor n="50" xml:id="d638-f1"/> and its
                    enclosure, and its despatch 474 March 27, 1928<anchor n="51" xml:id="d638-f2"/>
                    and its enclosures.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
